		"- Blackrock Mountain (PvP gear): General Angerforge 4:00, Warchief Rend Blackhand 8:00, Emperor Dagran Thaurissan 12:00, Majordomo Executus 16:00, Nefarian 20:00. Beat Azuregos to open.",
		"- Gates of Ahn'Qiraj (legendary gear): Kurinnaxx 4:00, General Rajaxx 8:00, Princess Huhuran 12:00, Ossirian the Unscarred 16:00, C'Thun 20:00. Beat Nefarian to open.",
