		"# Magnets",
		"A floating blue rune in a pillar of blue light. Walk over it and every coin and every bit of experience on the whole field flies to you. A run has two or three. Bosses drop them, and they never disappear, so you can save one for when the field is covered in gold.",
		"",
		"# Caches",
		"Caches are chests on the field that cost gold to open, and the price rises as you buy more (the run's screen shows the next price). A cache offers jewelry cards: rings, trinkets and amulets. Elites and guardians offer jewelry too. Each class also has legendary amulets of its own, one for every spell. The Codex in the Armory shows every piece the game has offered you so far. In co-op, every hero buys their own caches.",
